---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-spice-100 bg-spice-800 text-cream-100">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="lg:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-gold-500 font-serif text-lg font-bold text-spice-900">
          S
        </span>
        <span class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold">Shivrudh International</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-200">
        A Tamil Nadu based trading company exporting jasmine, turmeric and quality
        spices to buyers worldwide. Sourced at origin, graded for export, shipped
        with care.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400">Explore</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/products" class="text-cream-200 hover:text-cream-50">Products</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="text-cream-200 hover:text-cream-50">About us</a></li>
        <li><a href="/quote" class="text-cream-200 hover:text-cream-50">Request a quote</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="text-cream-200 hover:text-cream-50">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400">Get in touch</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-cream-200">
        <li>Tamil Nadu, India</li>
        <li><a href="mailto:info@shivrudhinternational.com" class="hover:text-cream-50">info@shivrudhinternational.com</a></li>
        <li><a href="/quote" class="hover:text-cream-50">Send an enquiry &rarr;</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-spice-700">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-2 px-5 py-5 text-xs text-cream-200 sm:flex-row">
      <p>&copy; {year} Shivrudh International. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Exporters of spices &amp; agricultural produce &middot; Made in Tamil Nadu</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
